# Community price API (specs/004-community-price-sharing): the Cloudflare Worker in worker/.
# VITE_COMMUNITY_API_KEY must match the Worker's COMMUNITY_API_KEY secret. It ends up in the public
# JavaScript bundle, so it only deters casual requests from outside the app; the Worker's rate
# limit and amount cap are what actually protect the data.
# For local work against a local database, run `npm run worker:dev` and use the URL it prints.
VITE_COMMUNITY_API_URL=https://dofus-craft-community-price-api.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
VITE_COMMUNITY_API_KEY=your-shared-app-key
